---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | RISK ON">
  <Header activeNav="privacy" />
  <main id="main-content" class="text-skin-base mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-4 prose-invert">
      <p>
        For shop orders, we collect only the information necessary to process
        your order: name, shipping address, email, and payment details.
      </p>
      <p>
        Payments are processed securely through Stripe. We do not store your
        credit card information on our servers.
      </p>
      <p>
        Order and shipping information may be shared with our fulfillment
        partner, Printful, solely to produce and ship your order.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you subscribe to the Base Rate newsletter or another email list on
        this site, your email address is collected and stored by our email
        provider (beehiiv) so we can send you what you signed up for. Our signup
        forms also record where you came from, such as the referring site or a
        campaign link, so we can see which channels bring in readers. You can
        unsubscribe at any time from the link in any email.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties for
        marketing purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have questions about your data, contact us at <a
          href="mailto:growingstateofmind@gmail.com"
          class="underline">growingstateofmind@gmail.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
